      "id": "claim_ceec7425ccb64798a734cb598e31240c",
      "statement": "BaseChatOpenAI is the core implementation shared by ChatOpenAI and AzureChatOpenAI, providing HTTP client management (sync/async httpx), OpenAI SDK client lifecycle, message conversion between LangChain and OpenAI formats, API selection (Chat Completions vs Responses), error mapping to LangChain exceptions, streaming with callbacks, and tool calling/structured output.",
