    {
      "id": "claim_9414a80b0bdd4386b747afdae3d51970",
      "statement": "ChatOpenAI http_socket_options parameter accepts TCP socket option tuples (level, option, value); defaults to conservative TCP-keepalive plus TCP_USER_TIMEOUT profile (~2 minute hang bound); can be disabled via empty tuple () or environment variables LANGCHAIN_OPENAI_TCP_KEEPALIVE, TCP_KEEPIDLE, TCP_KEEPINTVL, TCP_KEEPCNT, TCP_USER_TIMEOUT_MS; when proxy env vars are set without explicit socket options, auto-detection is bypassed with logging.",
